<h1>Brittany R. Bailey Preston</h1>
<p>Chicago Board of Education, District 9a, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Preston is the only candidate on the 9a ballot. In a social media statement she said she would focus on improving literacy, expanding trade and career pathways, and making CPS &quot;the most family-friendly school district in America.&quot; She did not return candidate questionnaires. She is endorsed by the SEIU Illinois State Council, The Urban Center, and the Common Ground Collective.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Auburn Gresham resident and mother of six who previously ran a construction company with her husband, state Sen. Willie Preston. She was removed from the ballot in her 2024 school board run.</p>
